Z||000000||samoht||08-24-2001||07:50 PM||||One of my freinds said that they made a tubro charged 2.8 citation... Is this true and will it work on a fiero ??? What isa good deal for a turbo charger kit?||||reg||1
Z||000001||Old Lar||08-24-2001||09:52 PM||||I don't know about a turbo Citation, but you can get a good turbo for a Fiero for any amount you are willing to pay. $1-$4K.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000002||terryk||08-24-2001||10:43 PM||||GM produced one turbocharged Citation called the Turbo 660. There were a few knock-offs made, but no mass production.<BR> <BR>IHI in a blow-through system with alcohol/water injection.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/citation_x11/history.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/citation_x11/history.html</A> <P><BR><p>[This message has been edited by terryk (edited 08-24-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000003||starfighter007@msn.com||08-24-2001||11:07 PM||||You know I think I remember something like that ,But what is comeing to my mind was the citation X-11 all I remember was that was the sporty citation.I am gonna start keeping my eyes peeled at the parts yard    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_watchout.gif">  <P>[This message has been edited by starfighter007@msn.com (edited 08-24-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by starfighter007@msn.com (edited 08-24-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000004||LivoniaFieroGT||08-24-2001||11:54 PM||||Worked at the Willow Run Plant (on the engine line) that made the Citation from 1980 - 1985.  The sporty version was a 2.8  X-11.  We never build a turbo unit.  Not even one as a special unit.  Must have been a job shop that did one.<BR>||||reg||8
Z||000005||terryk||08-25-2001||12:06 AM||||I owned a gazillion X-11's at one time. Used to be my Fiero addiction.<P>The Turbo 660 and the X-11 itself was GM's Jon Hienracy's creation. The knock-off's (something like 20) were some So. Cal. company's work. I saw one at O'Hare in the late 80's. I talked with Jon at length about the 660 and the X-11. Interesting story to that car. They have a following like the Fiero.||||reg||1
